# Yandex OAuth token. Auth scheme is "OAuth", NOT "Bearer".
# Create a token at https://oauth.yandex.com/ for an app with the
# "Yandex.Webmaster" permission. See README → "Getting a Yandex OAuth token".
YANDEX_WEBMASTER_TOKEN=

# Optional: default host used by `npm run smoke`.
# SMOKE_HOST=example.com

# Optional: opt-in IDN/Unicode-host resolveHost coverage in the smoke test.
# SMOKE_IDN_HOST=пример.рф
# SMOKE_IDN_PUNYCODE=xn--
